OL,3,GNEWSAMayor says new Baltic station plan
OL,4,Astill stacks up
OL,5,
OL,6,FLiverpool City Region mayor Steve
OL,7,FRotheram has said the business case for
OL,8,Fa new railway station in the Baltic
OL,9,FTriangle still stacks up, despite
OL,10,Frising costs and delays.
OL,12,FLast month it was revealed that #160m
OL,13,Fwould now be required to build the
OL,14,Fstation, significantly higher than the
OL,15,F#96m originally allocated by the
OL,16,FLiverpool City Region Combined
OL,17,FAuthority (LCRCA).
OL,19,FWhen the station was first proposed in
OL,20,F2022, the estimated bill was about
OL,21,F#80m, with work due to be completed by
OL,22,F2025.
OL,23,APub: 12-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NW Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
